Description = "Press the spring-loaded top plate to squeeze air from the side nozzle. Aim the burst at a windmill or chimes. Heavy loads keep the plate compressed; removing them lets its return spring refill it. Air flows only while the plate moves inward. Uses the game's ideal airflow model, not a pressurised-air network."
